# Course Selling & Xendit Payment Integration Plan (Simplified Flow)

This document outlines the architectural plan for integrating course selling and Xendit payments across the PT. Delta Indonesia Group projects, aligned with your requirements.

---

## Architectural Decisions

1.  **Separate Databases (Multi-Instance)**
    *   Each sub-project frontend/backend operates on its own database (e.g., `delta_lembaga_kursus`, `delta_indonesia_pranenggar`) and ports.
    *   This ensures isolated data storage, clean records, and ease of deployment on a single VPS.
2.  **No Student Accounts / Client Authentication**
    *   Learners do not need to register or log in.
    *   Authentication is reserved solely for Administrators to manage blogs/content via the existing `/admin` routes.
3.  **Streamlined WhatsApp Enrollment Flow (Data -> Pay -> Invite)**
    *   We will capture lead data *before* redirecting to Xendit. If a customer drops off on the payment screen, the PIC team still has their WhatsApp/Email details to follow up manually.

---

## Refined Transaction & Invitation Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Next.js)
    participant BE as Laravel Backend
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant Xen as Xendit API

    User->>User: Selects course & clicks "Daftar Sekarang"
    User->>User: Fills Registration Form (Name, WA, Email, Company)
    User->>BE: POST /api/course-registrations (form data + course_id)
    BE->>DB: Save to `course_registrations` (status: pending)
    BE->>DB: Save to `transactions` (status: pending)
    BE->>Xen: Create Invoice (external_id: invoice_number, amount)
    Xen-->>BE: Invoice URL & Invoice ID
    BE->>DB: Update transaction with payment_url & xendit_invoice_id
    BE-->>User: Return payment_url
    User->>Xen: Redirect to Payment URL (Pay via QRIS/VA/E-wallet)
    Note over User, Xen: User completes payment
    Xen->>BE: POST /api/webhooks/xendit (with payment status)
    BE->>DB: Update transaction to 'paid' & registration to 'completed'
    BE-->>Xen: HTTP 200 OK
    Xen-->>User: Redirect back to FE `/checkout/success?invoice_number=INV-xxx`
    User->>BE: GET /api/transactions/status/{invoice_number}
    BE-->>User: Return payment status ('paid') + WhatsApp Group Link
    User->>User: Click "Gabung Grup WhatsApp" to chat with PIC
```

